NPCs: {
	CyverBot.DisplayName: Cyver Bot
	CyverBotOrbiter.DisplayName: Cyver Bot Orbiter

	Cyvercry2: {
		DisplayName: Cyvercry
		SpawnInfo: Use {0} at night.
	}

	CrystalTumbler: {
		DisplayName: Crystal Tumbler
		SpawnInfo: Use {0} at the mysterious gate in the Crystal Caverns. Recommended after the Eye of Cthulhu, before the Eater of Worlds or Brain of Cthulhu.
	}

	MovingPlatform.DisplayName: Moving Platform
	FeatheredFoe.DisplayName: Feathered Foe
	CrystalBomb.DisplayName: Crystal Bomb
	HealerDrone.DisplayName: Healer Drone

	RockCollector: {
		DisplayName: Rock Collector

		Dialogue: {
			DemolitionistDialogue: e{0} just keeps going on and on and ON about blowing up the world. Please make it stop.
			DryadDialogue: e{0} is a pillar of the world community. Without her, I don't know what we would do!
			AnglerDialogue: Hate that angler guy. {0} really thinks fish rock. Pff.
			TumblerNotDownedDialogue: I heard legends of an ancient living boulder in the Crystal Caverns. Do you think it's really real?
			StandardDialogue1: Is that a new outfit? I dig it.
			StandardDialogue2: Hooks? Pickaxes? Cool mining accessories? You want it? It's yours, my friend. As long as you have enough money.
			StandardDialogue3: I heard in another world, gems weren't as useful! Can you believe that?!
			StandardDialogue4: Nothing like kicking back on the Rocks. Always love a drink.
			CommonDialogue: If you find any rare ore clusters, turn them into me for a reward!
			RareDialogue: I wish the moths didn't take over so much of my home. They're such beautiful creatures.
			TalkALot: I actually think I hear {0} calling my name! I have to go.
			TurnInChunk1: Wow! That's a big one, you found this in the mines?!
			TurnInChunk2: Amazing! I think I took you for... granite. Ha. Get it... granite. Here's your reward.
			TurnInChunk3: You are a natural collector. I am shocked with the quality of this one.
			TurnInSuperChunk: Goodness gracious! That's the biggest cluster I've ever seen! This will look good in my curio.
		}

		TownNPCMood: {
			Content: No complaints here!
			NoHome: While I can live out here fine, I would appreciate the courtesy of a home.
			LoveSpace: Cozy place you built up! Wanna kick back with me and a drink?
			FarFromHome: Oh, don't mind me, reconnecting with a fellow friend.
			DislikeCrowded: I'm afraid one of these townsfolk could sneak behind my back and steal my gems!
			HateCrowded: I feel like I'm in a bag of gravel.
			LikeBiome: The serene atmosphere of a snowstorm is very different to that of a thunderstorm.
			LoveBiome: Of course, I prefer living where my family resides.
			DislikeBiome: The soil samples here are a bit too... Dirty.
			HateBiome: I am RockCollector.exe and this is not genuine dialogue
			LikeNPC: I feel some kindred with {NPCName}, as another animated force of nature.
			LoveNPC: "{NPCName} is aware of my fellow rocks' spirits. She understands me shockingly well."
			DislikeNPC: "{NPCName} has the personality of a rockfish."
			HateNPC: "{NPCName} is a serial murderer! Please get him away from me!"
			LikeNPC_Princess: "{NPCName}'s eyes light up whenever I show her my collection."
			Princess_LovesNPC: "{NPCName} shows me so many cute gems!"
		}

		Census.SpawnCondition: Slay the Crystal Tumbler down in the depths of the Crystal Caverns
	}

